 "summaries": [
  {
   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2018-06-14",
   "text": "Choose Medicare Act\n This bill requires the Department of Health and Human Services to establish public health plans that are available on health insurance markets, subject to specified requirements; the bill also makes a series of changes related to health insurance costs, including alterations to cost-sharing provisions and the authority to negotiate prices under the Medicare prescription drug benefit."
  }
